==Description==
'''Sad Seal''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]]. It is obtained from Level 38 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{BeachBalls|1,360}} or {{Robux|84}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|24,220}} or {{Robux|3,507}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|106}} with a total cost of {{Robux|4,404}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|3,322}}. 

==Appearance==
'''Sad Seal''' shows the {{Color|Surf|Seal}} [[DJ Booth]] crying. A sound of a seal crying can be heard while using this sticker.

